<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia C/A surplus rises to $30.7 mln in Oct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia C/A surplus rises to $30.7 mln in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE</p>
<p> (in millions of dollars)	Oct	 Sept	Oct 95</p>
<p> Current account balance	30.7	 17.9	 37.7</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance     -82	 -75	  -43</p>
<p> Exports			     699	 724	  740</p>
<p> Imports			     781	 799	  783</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
